# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A lost sibling call leaves the capture waiting under its gate forever.
MODULE: CaptureSiblingCallLost
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture split of B awaits a SetPrevSiblingAsync call that was never sent
PERTURBS: CaptureCallSibling

--- FIND
    /\ sib' = "queued"
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT !["B"] = "awaitSib"]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the call is never sent
    /\ sib' = sib
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT !["B"] = "awaitSib"]
--- END
